    "Qualified current COFF and pin5EAC6F..5EACFB/5EACFF..5EAD8D show the same two-table walk and six repeated input/output-register operand differences. Existing global types, reference targets, data identity, signed extent and CFG agree; no layout defect is inferred. The isolated proposed pointer-induction form exposes the observed walk without forcing register allocation.",
    "Only the final output loops of get_clipped_x_table_shrink and get_clipped_y_table_shrink may change. Keep zero-extent early return before all writes, signed nonpositive behavior, output-parameter/store order, prefix loop, table identity, source read then table write then source_count increment, and possible output argument/table aliases. Guard positive do/while and pointer formation with extent>0. No headers, flags, ABI, storage, casts, safety fixes or unrelated bodies. All owner mappings are measurement scope only.",
    "Worker authors source and actual-source host controls in the isolated checkout using apply_patch; coordinator owns all Task/binding/annotation/Git/compiler-resource/CL/preparation/publication/integration operations. One paired candidate planned, cap3attempts/function/unchangedcontext including failures. Preserve all fullspans/identities/claims/lessons; only native record may bank any match.",
    "Compare actual original and candidate instructions/relocations, baseline and overlay replica and deliberate damage controls, all owner rows and outside-function code/data/references. Require alias-sensitive positive/zero/negative/bounds witnesses and compile-success mutant failures after unmodified witnesses pass. Fresh application build/link and scoped manual review precede integration; no native automatic/full-game acceptance follows from a loop spelling."
  ],
